== Description ==

'''Tungsten Bullet Tip''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 6 downstream recipes at the [[Gunsmith Workbench]], including [[7.62x39mm Tungsten]], [[7.62x51mm Tungsten]], [[7.62x54mm Tungsten]], [[9x19mm Tungsten]], [[D45 Tungsten]], [[5.56x45mm Tungsten]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

